Description: the deep canvas's strings in nine languages
 Three strings (the sentence that tells the person the canvas's depth after a
 step down, and its two depths, context canvas-depth) in Polish, Brazilian
 Portuguese, French, German, Spanish, Japanese, Korean and Chinese (simplified
 and traditional), additions only, in milestone 1's terms for the canvas and
 the log.  For GIMP's translators to take over upstream.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS (queue row 137, the stereo GIMP's milestone 3)
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-26
---
diff --git a/po/de.po b/po/de.po
index 07ee6c1..3401ecd 100644
--- a/po/de.po
+++ b/po/de.po
@@ -32397,3 +32397,18 @@
 #, c-format
 msgid "Layer group '%s' (%d) is not a depth layer"
 msgstr "Die Ebenengruppe „%s“ (%d) ist keine Tiefenebene"
+
+#: app/display/gimpdisplayshell-stereo.c
+#, c-format
+msgid "The canvas cannot hand this image's own depth and colours to the screen here: it is shown in %s. The reason is in the log."
+msgstr "Die Leinwand kann die eigene Tiefe und die Farben dieses Bildes hier nicht an den Bildschirm weitergeben: Es wird in %s gezeigt. Der Grund steht im Protokoll."
+
+#: app/display/gimpdisplayshell-stereo.c
+msgctxt "canvas-depth"
+msgid "16 bits"
+msgstr "16 Bit"
+
+#: app/display/gimpdisplayshell-stereo.c
+msgctxt "canvas-depth"
+msgid "8 bits"
+msgstr "8 Bit"
